weakspot.general.blockhealthbarenabled.tooltip=[Client] Show the remaining health of the block you are mining as a green bar along the bottom margin of its face.\nOnly for blocks you mine by holding left click that can have a weak spot.
weakspot.general.weakspottrailenabled.tooltip=[Client] Animate weak spots as they move: the marker quickly slides to its new place, leaving a short trail.\nVisual only: hits count at the new place immediately. Off switches in place. Also applies to other players' markers.

